note right
  **RAG Components:**
  * Documents → Chunks
  * Chunks → Embeddings (Vectors)
  * Query → Query Embedding
  * Vector Search (Similarity)
  * Retrieved Context + Query
  * LLM → Grounded Response
  * Citations & Sources
  
  **Key Techniques:**
  * Semantic chunking
  * Dense retrieval (vectors)
  * Hybrid search (vector + keyword)
  * Reranking
  * Prompt engineering
  * Citation extraction
  
  **Critical Metrics:**
  * Retrieval accuracy
  * Answer faithfulness
  * Citation accuracy
  * Response latency
  * User satisfaction
  * Cost per query
end note

@enduml
